cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use STIPS in your research, please cite it using the metadata below,
  and cite the LSST Science Pipelines it is built on.
type: software
title: "STIPS: the Small Telescope Image Processing Suite"
abstract: >-
  STIPS brings the Rubin Observatory LSST Science Pipelines to 1-meter class
  telescopes. It wraps the LSST reduction stack with a declarative instrument
  profile, prefab pipelines, and a unified command-line interface for
  calibration, difference imaging, forced photometry, and lightcurve
  extraction. Supported instruments are the Nickel 1-m at Lick Observatory
  and the CTIO 1.0-m with Y4KCam.
authors:
